      "message": "Let a place be reported, and let the forge act on it\n\nA public repository's page and a person's or organisation's page now\ncarry a Report link, which opens the form about that place and marks\nwhat it files as abuse rather than a bug; the place is filled in, so\nthe report says what it is about without the reporter spelling it.\nBeside such a report, the reports page offers what the forge can do:\nHide sets the repository private, Stop deactivates the account, and\nDismiss drops the report. Hiding and stopping are the ordinary acts,\nrecorded like any other and undone the ordinary way; the report stays\nuntil dismissed, so what was done about it is read from one row. A\nreport about a bug offers nothing but dismissal, whatever place it\nnames. Nothing is decided by a machine.\n\nTask: t-6vzmvzhg4k3vgdmswhcdmmswz0\nChange-Id: Ireport0130\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
